OL,3,GNEWSA'Not an easy inbox' for new
OL,4,AScottish Labour leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere's an old joke involving someone
OL,7,Fasking for directions, and the reply
OL,8,Fcomes: "Well, if I were you, I wouldn't
OL,9,Fstart from here."
OL,11,FAnd that's probably the (unhelpful)
OL,12,Fadvice a lot of people would give the
OL,13,Fnext Scottish Labour leader.
OL,15,FIt's a job that will go to one of two
OL,16,FMSPs this weekend - Michael Marra or
OL,17,FJoe Fagan.
OL,19,FThe victor will inherit a party that
OL,20,Fhad a historically bad result in May's
OL,21,FScottish Parliament election. They will
OL,22,Flead a group of just 17 MSPs.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
